<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Qantas plans greater cost savings.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Qantas plans greater cost savings.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qantas Airways Ltd said on Wednesday it expects to increase cost savings above the previously announced target of A$330 million for 1996/97.</p>
<p>Qantas said also it expected total additional product expenditure over a three year period to exceed A$430 million, with an additional A$280 million to be spent on terminal improvements.</p>
</text>
